          end: Duration(milliseconds: 466635),
          text: 'The boy’s expression changed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 466635),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 468134),
          text: '“You can hear me?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 468966),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 470509),
          text: 'Akhlaq stepped closer.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 470509),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 471578),
          text: '“Who are you?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 471578),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 474427),
          text: 'The boy looked at the compass.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 474427),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 476330),
          text: '“Where did you get that?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 476330),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 480247),
          text: 'Before Akhlaq could answer, shouting broke out.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 480247),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 484039),
          text: 'The boy grabbed Akhlaq’s wrist.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 484039),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 484914),
          text: '“Hide it.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 484914),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 485351),
          text: '“Why?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 485351),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 488851),
          text: '“Because you are not the first.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 488851),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 490772),
          text: '“Not the first what?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 490772),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 492997),
          text: 'The boy looked afraid.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 492997),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 494110),
          text: '“Traveller.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 494110),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 495222),
          text: 'Then he ran.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 495222),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 499323),
          text: 'They chased him into a narrow passage.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 499323),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 501303),
          text: 'But he disappeared.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 502112),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 512844),
          text:
              'On the wall was the same circle-and-line symbol as their compass, except the line crossed in the opposite direction.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 512844),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 513857),
          text: 'Beneath it:',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 513857),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 515881),
          text: 'DO NOT TRUST THE GUIDE.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 515881),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 519793),
          text: 'The compass began spinning.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 519793),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 521633),
          text: 'The city vanished.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 521633),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 525153),
          text: 'They returned to Ibn Kathir’s library.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 525153),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 527873),
          text: 'The scholar asked what they had seen.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 528309),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 532993),
          text:
              'Imaan told him about Ibrahim (A.S.), the idols and the question.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 533626),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 537153),
          text: 'Akhlaq did not immediately tell him about the warning.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 537153),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 559785),
          text: 'Then the mysterious journal opened by itself.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 559785),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 559786),
          text: 'Ink formed:',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 559786),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 559787),
          text: 'THE FIRST MARK IS OPEN.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 559787),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 559788),
          text: 'Then:',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 559788),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 559789),
          text: 'WHEN THE GREAT LIGHT DISAPPEARS, FOLLOW IT.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 559789),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 559790),
          text: 'The lamp went out.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 559790),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 559791),
          text: 'Above them appeared a huge night sky.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 559791),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 560494),
          text: 'A single star shone brighter than all the others.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 560494),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 565869),
          text: 'And from somewhere between the shelves came a whisper:',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 565869),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 570231),
          text: '“Do not believe everything your eyes admire.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 570231),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 575803),
          text: 'Challenge of the Day: Stand Apart for One Right Thing',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 575803),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 583209),
          text:
              'Today, choose one small right action even if the people around you are not doing it.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 583209),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 594209),
          text:
              'Return something that is not yours, refuse to laugh when someone is mocked, tell the truth when lying would be easier, or stop someone from wasting food or water.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 594209),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 596049),
          text: 'Do not show off.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 596049),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 599208),
          text: 'Simply choose what is right.',
        ),
      ],
    ),
