          start: Duration(milliseconds: 75335),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 79335),
          text: '“If they say it did it, they know that cannot be true.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 79335),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 82392),
          text: '“And if they admit it cannot speak…”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 82392),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 85335),
          text: '“Then they admit Ibrahim’s point.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 85335),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 89327),
          text: 'For a moment, the people recognised the contradiction.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 89327),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 91828),
          text: 'Their idols could not speak.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 91828),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 94545),
          text: 'Could not protect themselves.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 94545),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 97807),
          text: 'Could not explain what had happened.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 98662),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 99762),
          text: 'Akhlaq whispered:',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 99762),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 100740),
          text: '“They know.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 100740),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 103306),
          text: 'That was what shocked him.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 103306),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 107965),
          text: 'The problem was no longer absence of evidence.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 107965),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 110639),
          text: 'The truth had become clear.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 110639),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 116519),
          text: 'Yet instead of accepting it, many turned back towards anger.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 116519),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 125393),
          text:
              'Ibrahim (A.S.) made the contradiction explicit: why worship besides Allah things that could neither benefit nor harm them?',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 125393),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 129311),
          text: 'The mysterious boy pulled Akhlaq’s sleeve.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 129311),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 130911),
          text: '“You need to leave.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 130911),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 131254),
          text: '“Why?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 131254),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 135711),
          text: '“Because the story is about to become dangerous.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 136351),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 137878),
          text: 'Then they heard it.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 137878),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 140831),
          text: 'The people were talking about fire.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 141249),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 143551),
          text: 'Imaan felt cold despite the heat.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 144351),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 146231),
          text: '“They are going to burn him.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 146858),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 148111),
          text: 'Akhlaq stepped forward.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 149303),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 149516),
          text: '“We have to—”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 149516),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 152076),
          text: 'The compass struck his wrist.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 152076),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 152077),
          text: 'WITNESS. DO NOT REWRITE.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 152077),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 154956),
          text: 'The mysterious boy looked at him.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 154956),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 158619),
          text: '“Maybe you were not sent to save history.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 159123),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 160634),
          text: 'Imaan asked, “Then why?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 160634),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 165543),
          text: '“Maybe history was sent to save something in you.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 166343),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 170277),
          text:
              'Before they could ask more, the compass returned them to Ibn Kathir.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 170277),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 185935),
          text:
              'He explained that the people’s reaction showed something important: human beings do not always reject truth because evidence is missing. Sometimes truth requires giving up something they are deeply attached to.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 185935),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 187935),
          text: 'The journal opened.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 187935),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 191303),
          text: 'THE IDOLS COULD NOT DEFEND THEMSELVES.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 191303),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 194273),
          text: 'NOW WATCH WHO TRIES TO DEFEND THEM.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 194273),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 197483),
          text: 'Heat came through the next doorway.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 197483),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 200862),
          text: 'An enormous crowd was gathering.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 200862),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 203365),
          text: 'Wood was being prepared.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 203615),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 206498),
          text: 'And Ibrahim (A.S.) stood before them.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 206498),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 210679),
          text: 'Challenge of the Day: Admit One Mistake',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 210679),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 214411),
          text: 'Today, when you realise you were wrong, say:',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 214411),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 218159),
          text: '“I was wrong. I’m sorry. I will correct it.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 218159),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 220479),
          text: 'Do not add excuses.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 220479),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 224234),
          text: 'Then take one practical step to repair the mistake.',
        ),
      ],
    ),
    Story(
      id: 'ibrahim_en_04',
      title: 'Ep 4 · The Fire That Could Not Burn',
      narrator: 'Imaan & Akhlaq',
      coverAsset: 'assets/covers/ibrahim.webp',
      audioAsset: 'assets/audio/en/ibrahim/04_the_fire_that_could_not_burn.ogg',
      category: StoryCategory.prophets,
      description: 'Hazrat Ibrahim (A.S.) — episode 4 of 11.',
      captions: [
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 445),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 446),
          text: 'Episode 4: The Fire That Could Not Burn',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 446),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 3965),
          text: 'The crowd had everything that looked like power.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 3965),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 5005),
          text: 'Numbers.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 5037),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 6908),
          text: 'Noise.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 6908),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 8780),
          text: 'Anger.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 8780),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 10277),
          text: 'Fire.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 10277),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 13877),
          text: 'Ibrahim (A.S.) appeared alone.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 14220),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 22717),
          text:
              'Imaan and Akhlaq watched people carry wood and prepare to punish the Prophet who had exposed the helplessness of their idols.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 22717),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 29029),
          text:
              'One man shouted loudly even though he had barely listened to Ibrahim’s argument earlier.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 30029),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 31029),
          text: 'Akhlaq noticed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 31029),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 33529),
          text: '“He does not even know what happened.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 33529),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 36529),
          text: '“Maybe the crowd makes him feel certain.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 36529),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 40029),
          text: 'Nearby stood the idol merchant they had seen before.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 40029),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 42029),
          text: 'He looked troubled.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 42029),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 45021),
          text: 'Someone called him to stand with his people.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 45021),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 47421),
          text: 'After hesitating, he joined them.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 48365),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 49781),
          text: 'Akhlaq’s face fell.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 49781),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 52261),
          text: '“He knew something was wrong.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 52261),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 53661),
          text: '“Maybe.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 53661),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 55461),
          text: '“And still followed.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 55461),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 57501),
          text: 'The fire grew.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 57501),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 59341),
          text: 'The compass showed:',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 59341),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 61981),
          text: 'COURAGE IS NOT CONTROL.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 61981),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 64701),
          text: 'The mysterious boy appeared.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 65646),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 67093),
          text: 'Akhlaq asked what it meant.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 67093),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 68494),
          text: 'The boy replied:',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 68494),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 73773),
          text:
              '“You do not have to control the ending to choose what is right.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 73773),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 75653),
          text: 'Then came the Qur’anic moment.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 75653),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 77699),
          text: 'Allah commanded:',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 77699),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 82813),
          text: '“O fire, be coolness and safety upon Ibrahim.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 82813),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 85005),
          text: 'The unbearable heat disappeared.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 85005),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 87157),
          text: 'The fire remained.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 89882),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 96862),
          text:
              'But it could not harm Ibrahim (A.S.) when Allah commanded otherwise.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 96862),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 99057),
          text: 'The crowd fell silent.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 99667),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 100765),
          text: 'Akhlaq whispered:',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 100765),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 104178),
          text: '“They thought they controlled the fire.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 104997),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 106200),
          text: 'Imaan corrected him.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 106200),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 108005),
          text: '“They thought they did.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 108005),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 111014),
          text: 'Created power had reached its limit.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 111014),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 113439),
          text: 'The Creator’s command had not.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 113439),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 117505),
          text: 'Then the hooded traveller appeared at a distance.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 117505),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 123177),
          text:
              'A metal plate carrying the reversed compass symbol was left behind.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 123177),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 123784),
          text: 'It read:',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 123784),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 126236),
          text: 'POWER BELONGS TO RESULTS.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 126791),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 127761),
          text: 'Imaan frowned.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 127761),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 129840),
          text: '“That sounds wrong.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 130533),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 131919),
          text: 'Akhlaq understood.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 131919),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 142202),
          text:
              'If power belonged simply to whoever could force an outcome, then the crowd might imagine itself right because it could threaten one man.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 142202),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 144981),
          text: 'But truth was not created by strength.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 144981),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 148157),
          text: 'Their own compass responded:',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 148157),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 151201),
          text: 'POWER DOES NOT CREATE TRUTH.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 151201),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 153481),
          text: 'The false plate cracked.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 153481),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 157019),
          text: 'Back in Ibn Kathir’s library, the journal wrote:',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 157019),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 159161),
          text: 'THE FOURTH MARK IS COMPLETE.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 159161),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 159772),
          text: 'Then:',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 159772),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 163441),
          text: 'THEY TRIED TO OVERPOWER A MAN.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 163441),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 163442),
          text:
              'NEXT, MEET A MAN WHO BELIEVED HE COULD ARGUE WITH THE LORD OF THE WORLDS.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 163442),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 164961),
          text: 'A palace appeared.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 164973),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 170033),
          text: 'A ruler sat surrounded by guards.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 170033),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 174433),
          text: 'Ibrahim (A.S.) stepped forward.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 174433),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 179993),
          text: 'Challenge of the Day: Do One Right Thing Under Pressure',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 179993),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 184953),
          text:
              'Today, do one right thing even if somebody makes it uncomfortable.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 184965),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 194450),
          text:
              'Tell the truth, refuse to mock someone, return something that should not be kept, or include someone being excluded.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 194450),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 198965),
          text: 'Courage is not being the loudest person in the crowd.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 198965),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 203965),
          text:
              'Sometimes it is being willing to stand differently from the crowd.',
        ),
      ],
    ),
    Story(
      id: 'ibrahim_en_05',
      title: 'Ep 5 · The King Who Could Not Move the Sun',
      narrator: 'Imaan & Akhlaq',
