          text: 'A sincere question should move a person towards truth.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 138915),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 141475),
          text: 'The sixth mark completed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 141475),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 145175),
          text: 'Back in Ibn Kathir’s library, the journal wrote:',
