          text: 'Behind Ibrahim (A.S.) stood the world he had known.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 9608),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 11957),
          text: 'Ahead lay uncertainty.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 11957),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 22829),
          text:
              'The Qur’an tells us that Lut believed Ibrahim, and Ibrahim declared that he was going to his Lord, trusting Allah to guide him.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 23197),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 25589),
          text: 'Imaan and Akhlaq followed through the dreamworld.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 26509),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 30469),
          text: 'No crowd was threatening Ibrahim now.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 30469),
