          text: 'The mysterious boy joined them.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 66788),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 71469),
          text: '“Do you think leaving means losing?” he asked.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
