          text: 'Leave a game when it is time for prayer or family duty.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 206557),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 210477),
          text: 'Walk away from friends who are mocking someone.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 210477),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 213993),
          text: 'Choose what is right even when comfort pulls the other way.',
        ),
      ],
    ),
